\textdsversion{12}
[image] Gas meters in Massachusetts are required to be updated every seven 
years. When you receive a notice, please \htmlatk-link{schedule an 
appointment}. It's quick, free, and helps ensure your service continues 
without interruption.\
\enddata{text,4317473184}
